<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 400 MT included increases of 500 MT for Canada and reductions of 100 MT for Mexico.  Sales of 25,000 MT for delivery in 1997/98 were for Japan.</p>
<p>Exports of 3,300 were 49 percent above the prior week, but 54 percent below the 4-week average.  Mexico (2,800 MT) and Canada (500 MT) were the destinations.</p>
</text>
